  "body": "If we receive a request which is identical to a request we are already processing we should use the result of the request we are already processing to respond to the new request.\n\nOtherwise a client may give up on a request and submit an identical request, which will likely take an identical amount of processing time causing the client to give up on the request and submit an identical request....\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SYN-455)\n\n(Reported by @NegativeMjark)",
